2026-08-16T13:25:01Z    [DE:Worldwide net sales and revenues] GATE critic: Your growth input for FY2024Q3→FY2025Q3 is wrong. Deere’s own release says “Worldwide net sales and revenues decreased 9 percent, to $12.018 billion, for the third quarter of 2025,” but you used −8.6%. That understatement of the FY2025Q3 decline feeds your weighted YoY (−11.68%), biasing the FY2026Q3 projection upward by roughly $25–30m versus using the stated −9% (and properly normalizing the weights). This is a checkable discrepancy against the FY2025Q3 press release figure and percentage.
