2026-08-16T13:26:10Z    [DE:Production & Precision Ag operating profit] GATE critic: You anchored on FY2025 Q3 Production & Precision Ag operating profit as “(580)” but treated it as +$580m. In Deere’s financial tables, parentheses denote a negative value. If FY2025 Q3 was actually −$580m, applying a −12.65% YoY change would yield about −$507m, not a positive $506.6m—your forecast flips the sign and is therefore on the wrong side of zero.
