2026-08-16T13:26:31Z    [HD:Comparable sales, total company] GATE critic: The blend mixes scales: the seasonal_trend input “-0.075” looks like a fraction (-7.5%) while the build_up “1.13333” is in percent (1.13333%). Averaging them as if both were percent produces 1.0142%, but if “-0.075” is correctly treated as -7.5% the weighted result would be about 0.279% (1.13333×0.901 + (-7.5)×0.099), materially different.
